356
00:23:59,791 --> 00:24:03,750
Stay away from that one.
That's Rendra Oh's gang.

357
00:24:03,833 --> 00:24:08,208
A drug lord. Been in here five years.
He's running his meth lab in here.

358
00:24:09,166 --> 00:24:11,250
Yeah, he totally looks like a boss.

359
00:24:13,333 --> 00:24:15,208
That's not him.

360
00:24:16,125 --> 00:24:18,125
That's Rendra.

361
00:24:19,833 --> 00:24:21,916
Don't underestimate his looks.

362
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:23,583
He's not here for drugs.

363
00:24:23,958 --> 00:24:26,791
He stabbed someone in a club
just because he hated the music.

364
00:24:35,041 --> 00:24:37,500
He never got caught making drugs in here?

365
00:24:37,583 --> 00:24:40,375
Every inmate and officer knows.

366
00:24:40,458 --> 00:24:43,958
Come on, you're in Indonesia, not Norway.

367
00:24:45,916 --> 00:24:47,291
What about you?

368
00:24:47,375 --> 00:24:48,500
Which gang?

369
00:24:48,583 --> 00:24:50,000
You met Pendi earlier.

370
00:24:50,541 --> 00:24:51,833
He used to be a university lecturer.

371
00:24:51,916 --> 00:24:57,208
He tried to expose corruption on campus.
Got framed for theft.

372
00:24:57,291 --> 00:24:58,458
Across from him is Wildan.

373
00:24:58,541 --> 00:25:02,000
He's the most devoted out of all of us.
Super diligent.

374
00:25:02,083 --> 00:25:03,500
Why's he in here?

375
00:25:03,583 --> 00:25:05,333
Claimed he could
double money with prayers.

376
00:25:05,916 --> 00:25:08,708
The sickly one next to him is Six.

377
00:25:10,083 --> 00:25:11,000
Must've been a sixth kid.

378
00:25:11,083 --> 00:25:12,208
