What about you, bro?

388
00:25:47,250 --> 00:25:50,666
We're not bros yet.

389
00:25:50,750 --> 00:25:52,458
I'm in for phone scam.

390
00:25:52,541 --> 00:25:53,708
"Hello, sir?"

391
00:25:53,791 --> 00:25:56,500
"Your son was caught with drugs."

392
