397
00:26:11,458 --> 00:26:14,500
You feel bad for the victims?
You think I'm the evil one here?

398
00:26:14,583 --> 00:26:15,916
Let me show you what's evil.

399
00:26:18,250 --> 00:26:19,125
Over there.

400
00:26:19,208 --> 00:26:22,375
Block K. Full of corrupt officials
