424
00:27:17,833 --> 00:27:19,625
Not like that!

425
00:27:19,708 --> 00:27:21,125
Here, watch me.

426
00:27:21,666 --> 00:27:24,208
Before we start dancing,
we have to warm up first.

427
00:27:24,291 --> 00:27:25,458
That's Novilham.

428
00:27:27,208 --> 00:27:28,416
He teaches art class.

429
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:30,916
By the way, which cell did you get?

430
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:32,250
Block C.

431
00:27:32,333 --> 00:27:33,416
Cell number 31.

432
00:27:35,208 --> 00:27:36,208
Oh, damn.

