Every waking hour.

450
00:28:20,625 --> 00:28:23,625
<i>Don't take too long.
Direct order from the boss.</i>

451
00:28:23,708 --> 00:28:25,458
Understood, sir. By tomorrow.

452
00:28:25,541 --> 00:28:28,708
<i>This is a model prison,
so the work's easier.</i>

453
00:28:28,791 --> 00:28:33,916
<i>Handle this right,
and you'll be sitting where I am soon.</i>

454
00:28:34,833 --> 00:28:36,125
<i>Being a deputy minister is nice.</i>

455
00:28:36,208 --> 00:28:41,750
<i>You deal with respectable people,
not those animals in prison.</i>

456
00:28:41,833 --> 00:28:42,708
Yes, sir.

457
00:28:42,791 --> 00:28:46,541
<i>You'll become deputy minister this year,
minister in two years.</i>

458
00:28:46,625 --> 00:28:48,625
No, no. No way, sir.

459
00:28:48,708 --> 00:28:51,000
<i>In five years, I may be working for you.</i>

460
00:28:51,875 --> 00:28:53,541
