- I told him to have a drink first.

494
00:30:46,333 --> 00:30:48,500
He's got a job, you idiot!

495
00:30:48,583 --> 00:30:51,333
If he's drunk,
they'll suspect less, right?

496
00:30:51,916 --> 00:30:53,791
I'm doing you and your boss a favor!

497
00:30:53,875 --> 00:30:56,208
Hey. I don't have a boss.

498
00:30:56,291 --> 00:30:57,250
Watch your mouth.

499
00:30:57,958 --> 00:31:01,083
Remember, you're still nothing
but a doormat.

500
00:31:29,083 --> 00:31:30,666
What do we do? He's gonna die!

501
00:31:38,291 --> 00:31:40,041
Fuck.

502
00:31:54,125 --> 00:31:56,000
Dimas.

503
00:32:01,375 --> 00:32:03,125
You wanna get swollen,

504
00:32:04,500 --> 00:32:06,250
or you wanna get blendered?

505
00:32:13,500 --> 00:32:15,083
You're in my bed.

506
00:32:15,166 --> 00:32:17,166
I can't watch.

507
00:32:19,583 --> 00:32:23,500
Gotta carve you up tonight, pretty boy.

508
00:32:33,333 --> 00:32:36,208
But I'm too drunk.

509
00:32:39,125 --> 00:32:40,833
Tomorrow's fine, yeah?

510
00:32:49,750 --> 00:32:50,833
What's wrong with you?

511
00:32:52,250 --> 00:32:53,250
I saw a rat, sir.

512
00:32:54,000 --> 00:32:55,000
